# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages / Netlify. Vercel ignores this file (see
# vercel.json), and it is currently a no-op there anyway: GoRouter runs on
# Flutter web's default HASH strategy — nothing in lib/ calls
# usePathUrlStrategy — so deep links look like /#/jobs/123 and the server only
# ever sees "/". Kept so the app doesn't 404 on refresh the day someone
# switches to the path URL strategy or moves the host.
/*  /index.html  200
